SOME WHAT IMPORTANT SPOILER FOLLOWS!

You can also rust proof armor by dipping it into a potion of Holy Water.
Reading a scroll of enchant armor while confused is an alternative method
for blessing a piece of armor.  If you identify it after reading the
scroll while confused you will see that it is now blessed.  You could probably
also drop the armor on an altar to see that it is now blessed (but this will
NOT bless the armor for you).
